{"version":2,"slug":"explore-los-angeles-with-me-slow-english-listening-practice-2","videoId":"_6L7Sa8uQmk","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/_6L7Sa8uQmk","lang":"en","title":"Explore Los Angeles With Me | Slow English Listening Practice","category":"Vlog","channel":"Speak English with Bo's Slow English","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello everyone. Welcome to a new episode"},{"start":3,"text":"of Bo's Slow English. In today's"},{"start":6,"text":"episode, we are going to drive around"},{"start":10,"text":"Los Angeles. We are on our way to our"},{"start":14,"text":"friend's house and we will be eating"},{"start":17,"text":"Taiwanese food because he is Taiwanese"},{"start":22,"text":"and I actually don't think I've ever"},{"start":25,"text":"tried Taiwanese food. So, I'm very much"},{"start":29,"text":"looking forward to tasting this meal. I"},{"start":33,"text":"convinced this friend to start his own"},{"start":37,"text":"YouTube channel. So, he bought the same"},{"start":41,"text":"camera as me and I'm going to give him a"},{"start":45,"text":"tutorial on how to use the camera. Last"},{"start":50,"text":"time we drove to his house, I filmed it"},{"start":55,"text":"and we got lost several times. This"},{"start":59,"text":"time, I confirmed the directions with"},{"start":62,"text":"him."},{"start":63,"text":"So, hopefully we will not get lost. It"},{"start":66,"text":"is 73°"},{"start":70,"text":"Fahrenheit,"},{"start":72,"text":"which is a little bit crazy considering"},{"start":76,"text":"it is"},{"start":77,"text":"February 1st."},{"start":79,"text":"It is still winter time. I will describe"},{"start":83,"text":"my surroundings."},{"start":85,"text":"Ooh, watch out."},{"start":87,"text":"This here on the left side of our car is"},{"start":92,"text":"called a median."},{"start":95,"text":"And within the median,"},{"start":97,"text":"there are some trees planted."},{"start":102,"text":"A median separates"},{"start":104,"text":"oncoming traffic."},{"start":108,"text":"That is a big crane."},{"start":111,"text":"We are driving under the freeway."},{"start":115,"text":"We are currently driving through"},{"start":118,"text":"an area called Westwood."},{"start":121,"text":"UCLA"},{"start":123,"text":"or University of California,"},{"start":126,"text":"Los Angeles is located in Westwood. The"},{"start":130,"text":"metro station"},{"start":132,"text":"is getting built out here."},{"start":136,"text":"It will run through Westwood."},{"start":140,"text":"In Los Angeles,"},{"start":141,"text":"there are many"},{"start":143,"text":"billboards."},{"start":145,"text":"Although, I would call that"},{"start":149,"text":"TV advertisement"},{"start":152,"text":"a poster,"},{"start":154,"text":"not a billboard."},{"start":156,"text":"That over there,"},{"start":158,"text":"where the Uber"},{"start":160,"text":"ad is, that is a billboard. There's a"},{"start":163,"text":"lot of construction"},{"start":166,"text":"in the middle of the road,"},{"start":168,"text":"which is causing"},{"start":171,"text":"a traffic jam."},{"start":173,"text":"This car is trying to merge into our"},{"start":177,"text":"lane."},{"start":179,"text":"I'm not sure"},{"start":181,"text":"why there's always construction in"},{"start":184,"text":"Westwood."},{"start":186,"text":"I would consider this"},{"start":188,"text":"inconvenient"},{"start":190,"text":"because it is near"},{"start":193,"text":"the freeway"},{"start":194,"text":"and"},{"start":196,"text":"the traffic going onto the freeway and"},{"start":200,"text":"getting off of the freeway is already"},{"start":204,"text":"pretty bad. So, when you add this"},{"start":207,"text":"construction"},{"start":209,"text":"near the freeway,"},{"start":211,"text":"it will"},{"start":213,"text":"add to the traffic jam."},{"start":216,"text":"What they're doing right now is they are"},{"start":219,"text":"building the metro"},{"start":222,"text":"or the subway."},{"start":224,"text":"I wonder how long this will take."},{"start":227,"text":"There are many banks"},{"start":229,"text":"in Westwood,"},{"start":231,"text":"including Wells Fargo"},{"start":234,"text":"and Chase."},{"start":237,"text":"Do you have Wells Fargo and Chase in"},{"start":240,"text":"your country?"},{"start":242,"text":"I'm guessing the answer is no."},{"start":248,"text":"The lane all the way to the right"},{"start":251,"text":"is the bus lane."},{"start":254,"text":"Some people will speed down the bus lane"},{"start":260,"text":"to try and avoid traffic."},{"start":264,"text":"That is"},{"start":266,"text":"illegal"},{"start":267,"text":"and if"},{"start":269,"text":"a police officer"},{"start":271,"text":"sees you, you may get ticketed."},{"start":275,"text":"Westwood"},{"start":276,"text":"has a lot of"},{"start":278,"text":"high-rise"},{"start":280,"text":"condominiums"},{"start":281,"text":"or condos."},{"start":283,"text":"And if we go a little bit north of"},{"start":287,"text":"Westwood,"},{"start":289,"text":"there are large single-family homes."},{"start":294,"text":"I believe that area is called Holmby"},{"start":298,"text":"Hills."},{"start":300,"text":"I always thought pronouncing the word"},{"start":303,"text":"Holmby"},{"start":304,"text":"was a little bit weird."},{"start":307,"text":"Try pronouncing it. Holmby."},{"start":309,"text":"Holmby."},{"start":311,"text":"Apparently, a lot of movie stars live in"},{"start":315,"text":"Westwood."},{"start":317,"text":"Probably because they like the high-rise"},{"start":321,"text":"condos"},{"start":323,"text":"and it is pretty central to"},{"start":327,"text":"the entertainment area of Los Angeles."},{"start":332,"text":"We are driving"},{"start":334,"text":"east"},{"start":335,"text":"towards Beverly Hills."},{"start":339,"text":"My husband is going to get his haircut."},{"start":343,"text":"And while he gets his haircut,"},{"start":346,"text":"I will"},{"start":348,"text":"wander around aimlessly"},{"start":352,"text":"to try and get some good content for"},{"start":355,"text":"you."},{"start":356,"text":"When you say that you are"},{"start":358,"text":"wandering aimlessly,"},{"start":361,"text":"it means that you don't have a clear"},{"start":365,"text":"direction"},{"start":367,"text":"or"},{"start":368,"text":"destination of where you will be going."},{"start":371,"text":"We are entering"},{"start":373,"text":"the heart of Beverly Hills."},{"start":378,"text":"When you hear someone say it's the heart"},{"start":382,"text":"of a city,"},{"start":383,"text":"it means"},{"start":385,"text":"where everything is happening and busy"},{"start":389,"text":"and it's basically the center of the"},{"start":394,"text":"city."},{"start":395,"text":"There are many restaurants on the street"},{"start":399,"text":"as well as"},{"start":401,"text":"retail"},{"start":403,"text":"stores. I just walked inside a very"},{"start":406,"text":"popular grocery store."},{"start":409,"text":"Um it is hopping in here, which means"},{"start":412,"text":"it's really busy."},{"start":414,"text":"It's a little overwhelming how busy it"},{"start":417,"text":"is. I wanted to show you some of the"},{"start":420,"text":"aisles so you can learn some new"},{"start":422,"text":"vocabulary. I picked up a few chicken"},{"start":426,"text":"wontons from the hot food bar."},{"start":429,"text":"I'm feeling like I need a snack before"},{"start":433,"text":"my lunch."},{"start":435,"text":"I'm currently in the pasta aisle."},{"start":439,"text":"These are all the different types of"},{"start":442,"text":"pastas."},{"start":444,"text":"And here's the pasta sauce"},{"start":447,"text":"as well as pizza sauce."},{"start":450,"text":"There are all these different"},{"start":452,"text":"Asian-flavored sauces"},{"start":455,"text":"or condiments, I should say,"},{"start":458,"text":"such as"},{"start":459,"text":"fish sauce,"},{"start":461,"text":"tamari, which is like soy sauce,"},{"start":464,"text":"teriyaki sauce, an assortment [music]"},{"start":467,"text":"of hot sauce,"},{"start":470,"text":"mayonnaise"},{"start":472,"text":"or mayo,"},{"start":475,"text":"mustard,"},{"start":478,"text":"pickles,"},{"start":480,"text":"barbecue sauce,"},{"start":483,"text":"ketchup,"},{"start":484,"text":"canned olives or jarred olives,"},{"start":488,"text":"different types of oils,"},{"start":491,"text":"sesame oil,"},{"start":494,"text":"avocado oil,"},{"start":497,"text":"sunflower oil. This is the dairy"},{"start":501,"text":"section. So, we have yogurt,"},{"start":504,"text":"milk,"},{"start":507,"text":"ice cream,"},{"start":509,"text":"popsicles,"},{"start":511,"text":"frozen fruit to make smoothies,"},{"start":515,"text":"frozen vegetables."},{"start":517,"text":"Here's the pet food section."},{"start":521,"text":"Household supplies. Hi, sorry."},{"start":525,"text":"Toilet [music] paper,"},{"start":527,"text":"paper towels,"},{"start":530,"text":"plastic [music] sandwich bags,"},{"start":534,"text":"trash bags,"},{"start":536,"text":"waffles,"},{"start":538,"text":"pancakes,"},{"start":539,"text":"cheese,"},{"start":543,"text":"[music]"},{"start":543.6,"text":"deli meat,"},{"start":545,"text":"beef jerky,"},{"start":548,"text":"coconut water."},{"start":550,"text":"[music]"},{"start":550.6,"text":"I'm going to go stand in line so I can"},{"start":553,"text":"buy these chicken wontons and eat my"},{"start":555,"text":"snack."},{"start":557,"text":"We are now heading to our friend's"},{"start":560,"text":"house. Let me show you some of the"},{"start":564,"text":"houses here in Beverly Hills. It's"},{"start":567,"text":"really fancy."},{"start":570,"text":"Fancy is another word for"},{"start":575,"text":"expensive"},{"start":577,"text":"or rich."},{"start":579,"text":"Actually,"},{"start":581,"text":"these are not the biggest houses"},{"start":585,"text":"that I've seen in Beverly Hills, but"},{"start":587,"text":"they are still decently sized."},{"start":591,"text":"Wow, look at this massive house here on"},{"start":596,"text":"the corner."},{"start":598,"text":"Another way to say really big"},{"start":602,"text":"is gigantic."},{"start":605,"text":"It's a monstrosity."},{"start":608,"text":"It's huge."},{"start":610,"text":"Wow, look at that house."},{"start":612,"text":"It's crazy."},{"start":614,"text":"I have a question."},{"start":615,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":617,"text":"Tell us about a fun memory that you had"},{"start":623,"text":"growing up in Los Angeles."},{"start":626,"text":"One of the fun memories"},{"start":629,"text":"in Los Angeles is when we used to come"},{"start":630,"text":"out to Hollywood"},{"start":632,"text":"when my friends and I just"},{"start":635,"text":"started driving and we had our driver's"},{"start":637,"text":"license. We would come out to Hollywood"},{"start":639,"text":"to this place called Carney's,"},{"start":641,"text":"which is a old train caboose that was"},{"start":644,"text":"converted to a restaurant,"},{"start":647,"text":"and we would drive, we'd take the"},{"start":649,"text":"freeway there,"},{"start":650,"text":"eat, get our burgers and fries, and then"},{"start":653,"text":"take Sunset all the way"},{"start":655,"text":"to the beach,"},{"start":657,"text":"and then hang out. This is at night, by"},{"start":659,"text":"the way,"},{"start":660,"text":"and we'd hang out,"},{"start":662,"text":"park by the water,"},{"start":664,"text":"hang out for a minute, and then we'd"},{"start":666,"text":"head back"},{"start":668,"text":"on Sunset Boulevard all the way back to"},{"start":671,"text":"Los Angeles."},{"start":672,"text":"Oh, nice. This is a"},{"start":676,"text":"beautiful park here. We should come back"},{"start":679,"text":"here with Nari. Oh, it's a fire station."},{"start":683,"text":"I don't think we've been here with Nari."},{"start":687,"text":"The only time I've driven up this road"},{"start":690,"text":"is to see"},{"start":692,"text":"Jerry, is to go up to Jerry's house,"},{"start":695,"text":"which is what we're doing right now."},{"start":698,"text":"What was it like"},{"start":700,"text":"growing up in Los Angeles?"},{"start":703,"text":"Where I grew up, it was a bad"},{"start":706,"text":"neighborhood,"},{"start":707,"text":"but"},{"start":709,"text":"my"},{"start":710,"text":"family"},{"start":712,"text":"had us all focused on sports,"},{"start":715,"text":"so we were able to"},{"start":717,"text":"spend our free time"},{"start":720,"text":"going to practice and playing sports"},{"start":723,"text":"where"},{"start":724,"text":"some of the other kids in the community"},{"start":727,"text":"kind of went a different route. What is"},{"start":729,"text":"something that you learned from growing"},{"start":733,"text":"up in a rougher neighborhood?"},{"start":738,"text":"Always be protective of yourself and"},{"start":742,"text":"your friends and family."},{"start":744,"text":"In the rough neighborhood, we all had"},{"start":746,"text":"each other's back,"},{"start":748,"text":"so it wasn't like you walked down the"},{"start":750,"text":"street and you had to be worried about"},{"start":753,"text":"anything,"},{"start":754,"text":"but"},{"start":755,"text":"the adjacent neighborhoods were the"},{"start":758,"text":"neighborhoods you'd have to worry about,"},{"start":760,"text":"so"},{"start":761,"text":"I was raised to never visit those"},{"start":764,"text":"neighborhoods,"},{"start":766,"text":"where some of my friends weren't taught"},{"start":768,"text":"not to go visit those neighborhoods, and"},{"start":770,"text":"sometimes bad things would happen. What"},{"start":772,"text":"does it mean when you say"},{"start":775,"text":"you have each other's backs?"},{"start":778,"text":"[snorts]"},{"start":778.6,"text":"Having someone's back means you're"},{"start":781,"text":"looking out for them"},{"start":783,"text":"and you're taking care of them. You"},{"start":786,"text":"are very protective of your friends or"},{"start":790,"text":"your family. That's having someone's"},{"start":792,"text":"back."},{"start":793,"text":"Are you familiar with the term street"},{"start":796,"text":"smarts?"},{"start":798,"text":"Yeah, I think the streets"},{"start":801,"text":"teach you to"},{"start":803,"text":"um not be gullible and to kind of"},{"start":806,"text":"question people's motives,"},{"start":809,"text":"and again to"},{"start":811,"text":"watch your back and watch the back of"},{"start":813,"text":"others, so you're always"},{"start":816,"text":"um"},{"start":817,"text":"hyper-vigilant"},{"start":818,"text":"and"},{"start":820,"text":"I guess you you're just not gullible,"},{"start":822,"text":"you're very alert at what's going on"},{"start":825,"text":"around you."},{"start":827,"text":"What is the definition of gullible?"},{"start":831,"text":"Gullible, I would say,"},{"start":834,"text":"is clueless."},{"start":836,"text":"The famous Mulholland Drive. We're"},{"start":840,"text":"making a sharp right turn"},{"start":844,"text":"onto Mulholland Drive."},{"start":847,"text":"Why is Mulholland Drive famous?"},{"start":851,"text":"I think"},{"start":852,"text":"this is where"},{"start":855,"text":"James Dean"},{"start":857,"text":"crashed his car."},{"start":860,"text":"When I think of Mulholland Drive, I"},{"start":863,"text":"think of"},{"start":866,"text":"really windy roads,"},{"start":869,"text":"canyons,"},{"start":873,"text":"houses up on the hill like these."},{"start":877,"text":"It's a pretty clear day today. Wow, look"},{"start":880,"text":"at that guy cycling up this hill."},{"start":883,"text":"That's tricky."},{"start":886,"text":"How difficult is this ride on a"},{"start":888,"text":"bike?"},{"start":890,"text":"I was just thinking about"},{"start":892,"text":"is this road"},{"start":894,"text":"bike-friendly?"},{"start":896,"text":"I don't think it is. I think he's taking"},{"start":897,"text":"a risk, but it this is difficult. Yay,"},{"start":901,"text":"we did not get lost this time."},{"start":904,"text":"Or did we?"},{"start":906,"text":"Is this it?"},{"start":907,"text":"Mhm. Okay."},{"start":910,"text":"It's"},{"start":911,"text":"a really remote"},{"start":915,"text":"residential street."},{"start":917,"text":"I feel like he lives in a tree house."},{"start":921,"text":"His house is on"},{"start":923,"text":"stilts."},{"start":926,"text":"Oh, this is his house."},{"start":928,"text":"I love this house. Wait, no."},{"start":931,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":934,"text":"Okay, so they all have a similar style."},{"start":938,"text":"Um but this is his house, our friend"},{"start":941,"text":"Jerry,"},{"start":942,"text":"surrounded by all this lush"},{"start":946,"text":"green"},{"start":948,"text":"uh"},{"start":949,"text":"vegetation? Is vegetation the right"},{"start":951,"text":"word?"},{"start":952,"text":"His neighbor's house is pretty cool."},{"start":955,"text":"We're walking up his driveway."},{"start":959,"text":"His"},{"start":960,"text":"Tesla"},{"start":962,"text":"is charging."},{"start":964,"text":"Looks like he has two Teslas."},{"start":967,"text":"Hi."},{"start":968,"text":"[gasps]"},{"start":969,"text":"Oh, the door's open."},{"start":972,"text":"Hello, puppy."},{"start":977,"text":"Hi. [gasps]"},{"start":978,"text":"What's your dog's name again?"},{"start":980,"text":"Oh my god, you're so cute. Good girl,"},{"start":984,"text":"Olive."},{"start":987,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":988,"text":"Hi, Olive. Lead the way."},{"start":992,"text":"Shoes off? Yes, please."},{"start":994,"text":"Oh, he has a hang-up machine."},{"start":997,"text":"My dad uses his hang-up machine every"},{"start":999,"text":"day."},{"start":1001,"text":"Olive, come on, give us a tour."},{"start":1004,"text":"So, Jerry has a projector."},{"start":1008,"text":"Projector, not a TV."},{"start":1010,"text":"Where is the projector coming from?"},{"start":1014,"text":"Oh, this must be the projector. That's"},{"start":1015,"text":"cool."},{"start":1017,"text":"Olive."},{"start":1021,"text":"This is Olive's crate."},{"start":1024,"text":"You have a much bigger crate compared to"},{"start":1026,"text":"my dog."},{"start":1029,"text":"Olive is a beautiful husky."},{"start":1032,"text":"Look at the view from up here."},{"start":1035,"text":"That's a nice [clears throat] swimming"},{"start":1036,"text":"pool."},{"start":1038,"text":"These are beautiful"},{"start":1040,"text":"dining room chairs made out of leather"},{"start":1044,"text":"and wood."},{"start":1046,"text":"Olive, do you smell my dog?"},{"start":1048,"text":"Yes, yes, you do."},{"start":1052,"text":"You guys, this is the end of today's"},{"start":1055,"text":"vlog. I hope you enjoyed today's lesson,"},{"start":1059,"text":"and I will see you soon. Bye."}]}